Subject: [PATCH] nebula: Layer A @NebulaRW annotations on block-entity ticks
 (D16)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Annotates 6 block-entity tick functions with explicit RWSet declarations
per architecture §14.3 Phase 1 Month 4-6:

- HopperBlockEntity.pushItemsTick — self + facing W, above R
- AbstractFurnaceBlockEntity.serverTick — self only (smoker/blast furnace inherit)
- BrewingStandBlockEntity.serverTick — self only
- CampfireBlockEntity.cookTick — self only
- BellBlockEntity.serverTick — self + entity glow scan (* entities)
- BeaconBlockEntity.tick — column scan (* blocks) + entity effect apply

These declarations match the RWSets RegionTickDecomposer/BlockEntityTaskBuilder
already generates at runtime for these BE types. Annotations are the
spec; runtime RWSet construction is the enforcement. RW-Guard validation
of declared vs actual access is D17 (next).

